OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FThe UK housing market remained subdued
OL,7,Fin July, with home buyer demand and
OL,8,Fagreed sales showing little sign of a
OL,9,Fmeaningful recovery, according to
OL,10,Fsurveyors.
OL,12,FA net balance of 28% of property
OL,13,Fprofessionals in the report saw a fall
OL,14,Fin new buyer inquiries in July, which
OL,15,Fwas unchanged from June, the Royal
OL,16,FInstitution of Chartered Surveyors
OL,17,F(Rics) said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
