FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FAlthough still negative, it is an
OL,7,Fimprovement from a recent low of a net
OL,8,Fbalance of 41% of professionals who
OL,9,Fsaw buyer inquiries fall in March,
OL,10,Fwhich Rics said suggests the pace of
OL,11,Fdeterioration in demand has eased.
OL,13,FA net balance of 30% of property
OL,14,Fprofessionals saw a fall in sales
OL,15,Fagreed, which was also unchanged from
OL,16,Fthe previous month, although this was
OL,17,Fless negative than the 37% of
OL,18,Fprofessionals who saw a fall in April.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FBut expectations for house sales in
OL,7,Fthe months ahead are becoming more
OL,8,Fupbeat, with a balance of 3% of
OL,9,Fprofessionals expecting an increase,
OL,10,Fwhich is the most positive reading
OL,11,FRics has recorded since February.
OL,13,FThe flow of properties coming onto the
OL,14,Fmarket also showed signs of
OL,15,Fstabilising in July, with a small net
OL,16,Fbalance of 4% of professionals seeing
OL,17,Fa fall in new seller instructions,
OL,18,Fcompared with a more negative 23% of
OL,19,Fprofessionals seeing a decrease in
OL,20,FJune.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FHouse price falls continue to be more
OL,7,Fwidespread than increases across the
OL,8,Fmarket, Rics said.
OL,10,FA net balance of 30% of professionals
OL,11,Freported house prices falling, which
OL,12,Fwas slightly less than a balance of
OL,13,F32% who saw this in June.
OL,15,FLondon, the South East and South West
OL,16,Fof England continued to report more
OL,17,Fnegative price readings than the
OL,18,Fnational average, while professionals
OL,19,Fin Northern Ireland continued to
OL,20,Freport rising prices.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FAfter a sustained period of stronger
OL,7,Fgrowth, price momentum in Scotland
OL,8,Falso appears to be flattening,
OL,9,Faccording to the report.
OL,11,FOver the next 12 months, expectations
OL,12,Facross the UK are more positive, with
OL,13,Fa balance of 4% of professionals
OL,14,Fexpecting house prices to increase,
OL,15,Falthough London stands out as an area
OL,16,Flacking confidence, the report said.
OL,18,FIn the rental market, tenant demand
OL,19,Fremained broadly flat in the three
OL,20,Fmonths to July, while new instructions
OL,21,Ffrom landlords continued to fall.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FSurvey feedback continues to indicate
OL,7,Fthat some landlords are reducing their
OL,8,Fportfolios or leaving the sector
OL,9,Faltogether, Rics said.
OL,11,FThe report said members' feedback
OL,12,Frepeatedly points to a shortage of
OL,13,Fgood quality rental stock, alongside
OL,14,Fconcerns that taxation, regulation and
OL,15,Faffordability are influencing landlord
OL,16,Fand tenant behaviour.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FRics chief economist, Simon Rubinsohn,
OL,7,Fsaid: "The housing market remains
OL,8,Fsubdued, and while that is not usual
OL,9,Fover the summer months, it is clear
OL,10,Ffrom the Rics seasonally adjusted
OL,11,Fdata, that the combination of
OL,12,Fgeopolitics, the domestic political
OL,13,Fclimate and the cost of mortgage
OL,14,Ffinance are continuing to weigh on
OL,15,Fsentiment.
OL,26,@oD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,F"Significantly, the forward-looking
OL,7,Fmetrics also remain downbeat, which is
OL,8,Fnot the sort of climate likely to
OL,9,Fencourage housebuilders to step on the
OL,10,Fgas on existing sites or in land-
OL,11,Fbuying."
OL,13,FTom Bill, head of UK residential
OL,14,Fresearch at Knight Frank said: "The
OL,15,Fbackdrop is less volatile than last
OL,16,Fsummer but upwards pressure on
OL,17,Fmortgage rates and tax uncertainty are
OL,18,Fthe familiar causes of hesitation
OL,19,Famong buyers, which means demand is
OL,20,Fimproving but from a low base."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@HO]vD@`OU|D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
