OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FJeremy Leaf, north London estate agent
OL,7,Fsaid: "It may be down to the time of
OL,8,Fyear, but fewer listings mean the
OL,9,Frelatively low number of proceedable
OL,10,Fbuyers have less choice, which is
OL,11,Fslowly increasing the pace of decision
OL,12,Fmaking.
OL,14,F"However, the market remains price
OL,15,Fsensitive so generating buyer traction
OL,16,Fremains challenging, particularly
OL,17,Fwhile uncertainty about possible
OL,18,Fmortgage rate increases continues."
OL,26,@oD@GOUvD@AOUzD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
