OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786578479
OL,3,CHousing market struggled to gain
OL,4,Cmomentum in July, say surveyors
OL,6,FRachel Springall, a finance expert at
OL,7,FMoneyfactscompare.co.uk, said the
OL,8,Fweakness in new buyer inquiries "shows
OL,9,Fthe wider issues at play for the
OL,10,Fhousing market, as even with a
OL,11,Fseasonal summer slowdown, many buyers
OL,12,Fcould be worried about making a large
OL,13,Ffinancial commitment right now or feel
OL,14,Fthey need to delay their plans due to
OL,15,Fmortgage rate volatility".
OL,26,@pD@aOUwD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
